    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "Give each GF a configured, ordered spellbook. The Magic command must show that GF's complete list in its configured pages and order even when the character owns zero copies. A zero-stock spell stays visible, grey, and unusable. Some spellbook slots are unlocked by GF abilities; those slots stay grey until the ability is learned and still require nonzero spell stock to cast. The editor must expose each GF's spellbook order, page, spell, and optional ability prerequisite as mod data.",
